Frequently asked questions
I bought Crystals but they're gone after I reinstalled
Crystals are saved on your device. If you delete the game, they cannot be recovered, and Apple cannot restore consumable purchases. Ship Pack 1 is different: it can be restored (see below).

How do I restore Ship Pack 1?
Open the Shop from the top-right button and tap Restore Purchases. Ship Pack 1 unlocks the F-98, Stalker, and Probe ships. Restore uses the Apple ID you bought it with.

I was charged but didn't receive my Crystals
Email us with the date and time of the purchase and the pack you bought. We will look into it. Apple processes all payments, so you can also contact Apple at reportaproblem.apple.com for refund requests.

Can I get a refund?
Refunds for App Store purchases are handled by Apple. Request one at reportaproblem.apple.com.

Does Stellarena collect my data?
No. Your progress stays on your device. Read the full Privacy Policy.

